{"seq":4,"slug":"cost-latency-budgeting","title":"个人 Agent 的成本与延迟预算","stage":"DONE","category":"bridges","categoryLabel":"Bridges · 跨 Tier 协同","chapterCount":2,"docCount":6,"url":"/c/ai-books/bridges/cost-latency-budgeting","rating":{"composite":3.72,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"单用户、高频调用的个人 agent 有自己的经济学：成本结构与企业场景不同，预算要按用途分配并配执行机制，订阅与按量各有适用区。本模块给出个人尺度的成本画像、预算方法，以及缓存利用、模型×effort 路由与花费复盘三类最值得做的优化。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"personal-economics","title":"Personal Economics","docCount":3,"url":"/c/ai-books/bridges/cost-latency-budgeting/personal-economics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cost-structure-personal-scale","title":"个人尺度的成本结构","url":"/c/ai-books/bridges/cost-latency-budgeting/personal-economics/cost-structure-personal-scale","wordCount":2250,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"budget-setting","title":"预算的设定与执行","url":"/c/ai-books/bridges/cost-latency-budgeting/personal-economics/budget-setting","wordCount":2177,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"plan-vs-api-tradeoffs","title":"订阅与 API 的取舍","url":"/c/ai-books/bridges/cost-latency-budgeting/personal-economics/plan-vs-api-tradeoffs","wordCount":2163,"readingTime":9}],"introMarkdown":"本章面向单人维护的 agent 体系，拆解高频调用场景下钱到底花在哪里。先解剖个人尺度的成本结构，再给出从月度总额到单任务上限的预算设定与执行机制，最后比较订阅计划与 API 按量计费的取舍与混合策略。目标是让你对自己的账单有掌控感，既不超支也不因省过头而牺牲生产力。\n"},{"seq":2,"slug":"optimization-practice","title":"Optimization Practice","docCount":3,"url":"/c/ai-books/bridges/cost-latency-budgeting/optimization-practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"caching-for-personal-agents","title":"个人 Agent 的缓存利用","url":"/c/ai-books/bridges/cost-latency-budgeting/optimization-practice/caching-for-personal-agents","wordCount":2398,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"model-effort-routing","title":"模型与 Effort 的路由","url":"/c/ai-books/bridges/cost-latency-budgeting/optimization-practice/model-effort-routing","wordCount":2156,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"measuring-spend","title":"花费的度量与复盘","url":"/c/ai-books/bridges/cost-latency-budgeting/optimization-practice/measuring-spend","wordCount":2206,"readingTime":9}],"introMarkdown":"个人 agent 的成本优化不需要企业级的 FinOps 体系，真正值得做的只有三件事：把提示缓存用好、按任务难度路由模型与 effort、用最小的看板度量自己的花费。这一章逐一给出这三类优化的具体做法与配方，从缓存友好的工作习惯到月度复盘的三个问题。做完这三件事，多数个人工作流的账单可以降到原来的一半以下，而体验几乎不受影响。\n"}]}